WEBVTT

00:07:58.671 --> 00:08:01.848
Ak, tak, ak, tak. OK, tak poďme na to.

00:08:01.848 --> 00:08:03.024
Chyť ju za ruku.

00:08:03.024 --> 00:08:06.049
Môžeš ju dať dole na zem?

00:08:06.049 --> 00:08:08.255
Tak, na zem. Ty prejdi popod.

00:08:08.255 --> 00:08:12.072
Dobre. Cat, nohu na tú stranu. Tak.

00:08:12.072 --> 00:08:13.521
A otočiť.

00:08:13.521 --> 00:08:14.637
Super, naspäť od začiatku.

00:08:14.637 --> 00:08:20.985
Poďme na to, pripravení? A... bam, bam ... (metronóm)

00:08:20.985 --> 00:08:22.909
Super. OK, odtiaľto obaja vstanete.

00:08:22.909 --> 00:08:26.434
Obaja vstanete. Ideme. Dobre. Potom...

00:08:26.449 --> 00:08:28.018
(potlesk)

00:08:28.018 --> 00:08:30.719
Odtiaľ, odtiaľ obaja vstanete,